{
 "id": "seg4",
 "title": "三个共同点",
 "pill": 4,
 "total": 69.22,
 "lines": [
  {
   "id": "seg4-00",
   "text": "六起事件，打在六个不同的位置。结果却一样：签名系统正常运行，签出了攻击者想要的东西。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep29/audio/lines/seg4-00.mp3",
   "start": 1.6,
   "dur": 8.616,
   "speechStart": 1.698,
   "speechEnd": 9.362
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-01",
   "text": "把它们叠在一起，能看到三个共同点。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep29/audio/lines/seg4-01.mp3",
   "start": 10.436,
   "dur": 3.672,
   "speechStart": 10.534,
   "speechEnd": 13.272
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-02",
   "text": "第一，校验放错了位置。下游只检查请求的格式，不检查请求背后，有没有真实的业务。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep29/audio/lines/seg4-02.mp3",
   "start": 14.328,
   "dur": 8.112,
   "speechStart": 14.426,
   "speechEnd": 21.602,
   "spoken": "第一，较验放错了位置。下游只检查请求的格式，不检查请求背后，有没有真实的业务。"
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-03",
   "text": "第二，关键输入只有一个来源。一块屏幕，一组 RPC，一个发布包，一条审批路径。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep29/audio/lines/seg4-03.mp3",
   "start": 22.66,
   "dur": 7.968,
   "speechStart": 22.758,
   "speechEnd": 29.791
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-04",
   "text": "第三，响应只管链下。关掉服务，也无法改变已经写在链上的状态。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep29/audio/lines/seg4-04.mp3",
   "start": 30.848,
   "dur": 6.552,
   "speechStart": 30.944,
   "speechEnd": 36.565,
   "spoken": "第三，响应只管链下。关掉服务，也无法改变已经写在链上的状态。"
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-05",
   "text": "回到开头那句话。私钥保护，回答的是谁拿着钥匙。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep29/audio/lines/seg4-05.mp3",
   "start": 37.62,
   "dur": 5.544,
   "speechStart": 37.718,
   "speechEnd": 42.31
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-06",
   "text": "签名路径，回答的是谁决定，钥匙盖在什么文件上。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep29/audio/lines/seg4-06.mp3",
   "start": 43.384,
   "dur": 4.896,
   "speechStart": 43.482,
   "speechEnd": 47.446
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-07",
   "text": "所以防御也是三条。第一，每一层都重新检查，不继承上一层的结论。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep29/audio/lines/seg4-07.mp3",
   "start": 48.5,
   "dur": 7.008,
   "speechStart": 48.598,
   "speechEnd": 54.655
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-08",
   "text": "第二，关键输入要有多个独立来源，对不上就拒签，不自动切换。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep29/audio/lines/seg4-08.mp3",
   "start": 55.728,
   "dur": 5.928,
   "speechStart": 55.826,
   "speechEnd": 60.814
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-09",
   "text": "第三，响应要覆盖链上状态。暂停提现，不等于撤销权限。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep29/audio/lines/seg4-09.mp3",
   "start": 61.876,
   "dur": 6.144,
   "speechStart": 61.974,
   "speechEnd": 67.185
  }
